CampaignHints:
-- English counterparts of the ordered, state-driven tasks in the campaign definitions.
local H={}
H.tasks={
[1]={
 {"Look at the low cabinet.","A teammate's back raises your starting point.","Place Tangyuan beside the cabinet; empty-handed Meiqiu jumps onto his back, then the top latch."},
 {"Check the narrow route under the cabinet.","Empty-handed Naigai can crawl through and leave the side door open.","Drop Naigai's ball, crawl to the other side and press E at the latch."},
 {"Look at the plate, nest door and brace behind it.","Hold the plate to open the door; a teammate can brace it from the far side.","Leave a full ball in the tray, or let Tangyuan hold the plate while a teammate crosses and presses E at the brace. Then bring everyone home."}},
[2]={
 {"Check the seesaw and bookcase.","Weight on the left lifts a light cat on the right.","Tangyuan holds the left down without a ball; empty Naigai rides up, jumps to the shelf and opens the ramp latch."},
 {"Check the two small plate slots.","Two halves can hold both plates at once.","Cut one ball at the table. Leave one half in A, then jump the low shelf with the other half for B."},
 {"Check plate B and its book stop.","Full balls cannot fit; a bounced half is still recoverable.","Meiqiu carries a half to the upper slot and leaves it there, then all cats go home."}},
[3]={
 {"Check the cat tree beside the pool.","The lever unfolds a safe bridge.","Empty Meiqiu jumps up to the bridge lever and presses E."},
 {"Check the heavy plate and inner gap.","Water makes the same ball weigh 4; keep the door open from inside.","Tangyuan places the felt ball on the plate; empty Naigai sets the inner latch before retrieving it."},
 {"Check the small stand past the carpet.","Its lever unfolds the delivery ramp.","Empty Meiqiu jumps onto the small stand and operates the ramp lever."},
 {"Check the metal post with electric markings.","The carpet charges the felt ball; the wet floor is slippery.","Recover the same felt ball, cross the carpet, then push it up the short ramp to the metal post."}},
[4]={
 {"Check the drying bridge over the airflow.","Empty Naigai weighs 1 and can ride the air.","Drop Naigai's ball, ride up and operate the drying-bridge latch."},
 {"Check the wind lever on the upper stand.","Optional wind route: deliver a ball into the cradle, then secure the sail winch to keep the exit open.","Meiqiu sets rightward wind and clears the clip. Tangyuan sends a full ball down the wind track, then presses E at the sail winch. The weight plate and inner brace remain an alternative."},
 {"Check the exit plate marked 4.","S picks up the fish; eating it adds body weight. Cats and halves can also share the load.","Tangyuan picks up the fish with S, eats it at the marked spot and stands on the plate; Naigai sets the inner latch before everyone leaves."}},
[5]={
 {"Check the loom and high near hook.","Cut a full ball into two halves, then weave them into rope.","Bring the rope to the ground feed slot; empty Meiqiu jumps up and secures the near hook."},
 {"Check the narrow under-bed path and advancing rope tip.","Empty Naigai reaches the far shore and secures the other end.","Wait for the rope tip to arrive, then press E at the far hook with empty Naigai."},
 {"Check the bridge marked load 2 and the far support.","Empty Meiqiu crosses first; Naigai opens the wide bridge for heavy cargo.","Cross one cat at a time, open the far switch with Meiqiu, then lower the wide bridge with Naigai. Recover rope from the far-side outlet without walking back."}},
[6]={
 {"Check the fish rack near the start.","Stand beside it and use the same pickup key as yarn.","Press S to pick up the fish, then carry it to the mouse dish."},
 {"Check the high route lever and narrow cargo gap.","Walking into the left or right side sets the delivery route.","Use empty Meiqiu to push the lever toward the main route; empty Naigai reaches the cargo latch."},
 {"Check the mouse window and receiving plate.","One fish hires the mouse for all deliveries in this room. The nearby dish selects the secret route without another meal.","Deliver a full ball to the main plate, then use the nearby secret-route dish and ask the mouse to fetch the secret yarn. No second fish or climb to the lever is needed."}},
[7]={
 {"Check the control stand and outer carrier.","The outer carrier moves cats; the inner drum felts yarn.","Empty Meiqiu jumps onto the control stand and enables the carrier. Either pause cord can stop it."},
 {"Check the upper and lower delivery markings.","The wrong setting returns cargo to the lower tray without deleting it.","Naigai selects upper delivery. Tangyuan loads a full ball to start washing automatically; the carrier can be paused independently."},
 {"Check the upper heavy plate and folding stairs.","A felt ball weighs 4; the stairs stay open after activation.","Deliver felt to the upper plate; empty Meiqiu rides up and releases the wide stairs, then all cats go home."}},
[8]={
 {"Check the path behind the boxes.","Empty Naigai can open a lasting wide route.","Drop Naigai's ball, crawl past the boxes and open the side latch."},
 {"Check the books, bell and toy area.","Books unfold a ramp; the bell and decoy offer alternative distractions.","Use Meiqiu to push the books, or use the bell or a decoy instead. Tangyuan opens the shoe cabinet while Naigai secures the divider."},
 {"Check the safety divider behind Wangcai.","Latch it before recovering original yarn.","Naigai locks the divider. If the dog raises its ears, retreat behind boxes or place a free decoy."}},
[9]={
 {"Check the cutting table, loom and pulley hook.","The pulley needs rope made from existing yarn.","Cut a full ball, weave both halves and install the rope at the pulley hook."},
 {"Check both mirrors' landing points.","The red dot and Naigai's weight must meet at the far plate.","Meiqiu aims mirror one to the low stand and mirror two to the far plate; then load and operate the pulley."},
 {"Check the upper receiving plate and ratchet.","A delivered full ball weighs 3; the stairs stay unlocked.","Wait for cargo on the upper plate. Move Naigai manually to take control, or switch the laser off; bring everyone up the stairs. A mirror can restart following."}},
[10]={
 {"Check area A's plan and small slots.","Two halves, the high latch and the crawl latch keep the route open.","Cut one ball for A/B slots; Meiqiu jumps from Tangyuan's back to the high latch, Naigai opens the crawl latch and timed door. Once the hall is secured, use the material chute beside checkpoint A to send both halves to the loom together. Save A."},
 {"Light the first lamp in area B.","Empty Meiqiu can jump onto the lamp shelf.","Drop Meiqiu's cargo, jump from the left of the shelf and press E beside the emergency lamp."},
 {"Check the low lamp behind the towel.","Empty Naigai uses the low route after the towel moves.","Move the towel with E, then have empty Naigai switch on the second lamp."},
 {"Area B needs a transport connection and weight 4.","Weave both halves into rope; send one full ball into water.","Install the rope, use the pulley with Meiqiu, put the felt ball on the heavy plate and set the inner brace with Naigai."},
 {"Watch the paper warning before the vacuum starts.","Empty Meiqiu shuts suction from above; Naigai opens the recoverable dustbin.","Save B, jump Meiqiu onto the high road and shut the vacuum with E. Collect the nearby secret; Q scares the thief."},
 {"The final dog gate has three routes.","Use a full ball, a free decoy, or the high side route.","Open the bait gate or side latch, lock the safety divider, retrieve original bait and bring everyone home."}},
[11]={
 {"Check the furniture path behind the entry shadow.","Empty Naigai crawls through to open the wide route.","Drop the working ball, send Naigai behind the furniture and press E at the side latch."},
 {"Yarn in the basket is the first evidence task.","All three working balls belong in one basket; story yarn is unchanged.","Store each ball with E. Empty Tangyuan can toggle basket dragging; slow down beside the door frame."},
 {"Check the two marked tools above.","Empty Meiqiu puts scissors and the spool away before closing the lid.","Press E beside each tool, then close the tool box with E once both are stored."},
 {"Check the machine-cover stand.","Empty Naigai pulls the cover down to complete all three tasks.","Avoid sight or use a free decoy, pull the cover with E, then save at the evidence checkpoint."}}
}
H.final={"The main route is held open; check the remaining cats and secret path.","All yarn forms, installed materials and machine cargo count toward recovery.","Bring each remaining cat home. Hints cost no stars; collect the unique secret if you still can."}
H.tasks[11][2],H.tasks[11][4]=H.tasks[11][4],H.tasks[11][2]
H.tasks[11][2]={"Check the low stand beside the machine.","Naigai can cover the machine first, leaving the entry workspace clear for teammates. Tidy in parallel.","Empty Naigai pulls down the machine cover, then waits in furniture shadow for the others."}
H.tasks[11][4]={"Check how much working yarn is still missing from the basket.","Each cat can deliver its own yarn; Tangyuan can also gather nearby loose yarn. Dragging is optional.","Press E to hand over carried yarn, or collect loose yarn beside the basket empty-handed. Save after tidying and bring everyone home."}
H.tasks[11][3]={"Check the scissors and spool on the shelf.","Meiqiu hands in his own yarn before climbing empty-handed, keeping the floor clear for teammates.","Deliver Meiqiu's yarn to the basket, jump to the tool shelf, store both tools and close the lid. Wait in the machine-side shadow when done."}
H.hiddenFinal={"All three evidence tasks are done; head for the sleeping nest.","A question mark gives time to retreat until the entire tail is in cover.","Bring each cat home. Being spotted returns only that cat; completed evidence stays."}
H.bathFinal={"The nest door is open; look for the brace behind it.","Brace the door before releasing the magnet to recover the same yarn.","Send a cat through and press E at the brace. The others may release the magnet, recover the yarn and head home."}
H.tasks[2][3][2]="Only halves fit. Carry one onto the low shelf, or use the book chute to send the original half to B."
H.tasks[3][3]={"Check the movable bathroom step and upper lever.","Weight 3+ can move the step, or Meiqiu can use the original lever.","After bracing the inner door, move the step with E. Charge the same felt on the carpet and send it along the ramp to the metal post."}
H.tasks[5][1][2]="One rope, two hanging options: the high hook, or the low drawer hook after opening the drawer."
H.tasks[5][1][3]="Cut and weave once. Meiqiu can use the high hook; alternatively Tangyuan opens the drawer and attaches loose rope at the low hook. Naigai secures the far end."
H.tasks[7][3][3]="Once felt reaches the upper plate, pull the ground outlet rope to lower the return ramp, or use the upper support. Midway stops and the high secret are optional."
H.tasks[9][1]={"Inspect the installed working rope.","Naigai's original 6 yarn units are already installed; no cutting or weaving is required.","Use the remaining full balls for transport. Mirrors can guide Naigai to the pedal, cart or secret cabinet."}
H.tasks[9][2][2]="Aim at the pedal, cart or secret cabinet. Manual takeover stays in effect until you adjust a mirror again."
H.tasks[10][3][3]="Empty Naigai can press E at the low lamp to uncover and light it together. Removing the towel first also works."
H.tasks[10][4][3]="Send both halves through the material chute and weave once. The full-ball relay beside A sends waiting original cargo to the pulley. Tangyuan loads felt onto the heavy plate; Naigai braces the door."
return H
